3. APPLICATION ARCHITECTURE


Build the application using:


- React and TypeScript.
- Responsive mobile-first design.
- Firebase Authentication.
- Cloud Firestore.
- Firebase Storage for product photographs if required.
- Firebase Hosting or another suitable deployment platform.
- PWA manifest and service worker.
- Secure, environment-based Firebase configuration.


Organise the code into reusable components and maintainable modules.


Do not put API keys, private credentials or secrets on the screen or in publicly exposed configuration.


