Requirements:


- Users can read and update only their own profiles.
- Users can read and modify only their own favourites.
- Users can create and read their own order requests.
- Customers must never edit product prices or business settings.
- Only authorised administrators can manage products, prices, delivery fees and business settings.
- Never use open public write permissions.
- Validate important fields and data types in Firestore rules.


Use Firebase Admin SDK or trusted server-side functionality for privileged administrative operations.


